//@version=6
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  KEY LEVELS • ZONES • STRUCTURE   [K]
//
//  Built around the "mark your levels / zones, then execute the rejection" playbook.
//
//  LEVELS   Previous + current Month / Week / Day high-low (labels that sit on
//           the same price merge, e.g. "MONTH HIGH / WEEK HIGH"), Friday close,
//           daily / weekly open, 4H + 30M swing support / resistance,
//           Asia / London / New York session highs & lows (hidden once swept),
//           round numbers and 4 manual levels (WEEKLY RESISTANCE / SUPPORT ...).
//  ZONES    SELL / BUY zones = order block at the origin of every break of
//           structure, with the yellow displacement leg; they flip to BREAKER
//           when closed through. 4H SELL / BUY zones. FVG -> IFVG.
//           Optional swing rejection (wick) zones.
//  TOOLS    BOS / CHoCH, auto fib of the active structure leg
//           (0 / 23.6 / 38.2 / 50 / 61.8 / 65 / 71 / 78.6 / 88.6 / 100 + OTE),
//           volume profile histogram (buy / sell split, POC, value area),
//           session boxes, EMAs.
//  SIGNALS  Rejection / sweep of any level or zone on a CLOSED candle (no
//           repaint) + alerts, with plain stats (wins / losses at a fixed R).
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
indicator("Key Levels • Zones • Structure [K]", shorttitle = "KLZ", overlay = true, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 500, max_bars_back = 1000)

// ═══════════════════════════════ INPUTS ═══════════════════════════════
